Description: |
  Generic merge-sorted key-value storage primitive underlying `lib/storage`'s inverted index
  (indexDB). Confirmed by source reading and import-graph analysis to have exactly one
  production caller in the whole repository (`lib/storage/index_db.go`) plus a config-only
  touch from `app/vmstorage` (cache-size flags) — genuinely a self-contained, reusable building
  block, not storage-specific logic duplicated elsewhere.
